{
  "suite": "weekendwise-local-eval-v5",
  "description": "Synthetic evaluation cases for all four demo cities. 'mode' says how a case runs: 'plan' sends a trip request to the planner (fields in 'request' override the default trip: the case's city, 14–16 May 2027, 2 travelers, $600, the question as notes; a trip_scenario_id starts from that scenario's request); 'ask' sends the question to the grounded single-answer path. Expectations are fixtures, not a claim that a model has passed. Run with make evaluate.",
